{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkpJo3ecPopk255DxUMW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01M5W4K6BzJYTTw98VWrAnu8","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"sed -n 278,290p tests/browser/all.mjs | cut -c1-260; grep -n \"attract\" tests/headless/all.mjs | cut -c1-200 | head -n 8; wc -l tests/ISSUES.md; python3 - <<'EOF'\np='src/ui/menus/shell.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    const y = bigTitle(ui);\n    ui.text(ui.w / 2, y, 'THE BELL IS CRACKED. THE DEAD ARE UP. SO ARE YOU.', { color: 'mist', align: 'center' });\n    if (g.frame\"\"\",\"\"\"    bigTitle(ui);\n    // Low on the screen: the cracked bell sits under the title and should be seen whole.\n    const tag = ui.wrap('THE BELL IS CRACKED. THE DEAD ARE UP. SO ARE YOU.', ui.w - 16);\n    tag.forEach((l, i) => ui.text(ui.w / 2, ui.h - 56 + (i - tag.length + 1) * 10, l, { color: 'mist', align: 'center' }));\n    if (g.frame\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncat >> tests/ISSUES.md <<'EOF'\n- minor: (screenshot) toasts ran over the minimap and player panels and piled up five deep: now a centre column, three at most, one elite notice at a time\n- minor: (screenshot) Malison stood off-screen from the arena door: the camera now pulls toward a huge boss and widens\n- minor: (screenshot) item labels on the floor cut names mid-word (\"ROUND SHIELD OF .\"): long names now drop their \"OF\" tail\n- minor: (screenshot) touch-only notice stacked over the attract title, HUD and keyboard prompts: one notice over the demo now\n- minor: (screenshot) attract DEMO block sat on the boss bar and told the watcher to press WASD: moved under the bar, prompts hidden\n- minor: (screenshot) keyboard \"HOLD TO SKIP\" prompt ran off the right edge in cutscenes\nEOF","description":"Move title tagline and log screenshot issues"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"